// icons/windows/naturalPaint.rc.in -- the .exe's own icon (Explorer, the
// taskbar, Alt-Tab). src/CMakeLists.txt configures this into the build tree
// under `if(WIN32)` with an ABSOLUTE path to the .ico, because MSVC's rc and
// MinGW's windres disagree about what a relative path in a .rc is relative
// to. The first ICON resource in a module is the one the shell shows.
//
// NOT BUILT OR TESTED YET: Windows surface creation is still an #error
// (README.md), so no Windows build of this target exists to compile it.
IDI_APP_ICON ICON "@NP_APP_ICON_ICO@"
